#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:5
#: 4d3d98f4e5574148a7aa3640ffca5ad2
msgid "RunCam Camera Support"
msgstr "RunCam 相机支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:8
#: 8255b9169a59440695bb3157904af624
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:10
#: 871b42115a124ca28e5bae3905668690
msgid ""
"RunCam devices support the `Runcam Device Protocol "
"<https://support.runcam.com/hc/en-us/articles/360014537794-RunCam-Device-"
"Protocol>`_ which is the serial communication protocol initially developed "
"for the RunCam Split and analog cameras."
msgstr ""
"RunCam 设备支持 `Runcam Device Protocol <https://support.runcam.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360014537794-RunCam-Device-Protocol>`_，这是最初为 RunCam Split "
"和模拟相机开发的串行通信协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:12
#: e454e5d72d304003b5cae6bdb9ab694e
msgid ""
"The protocol itself supports not only full camera OSD menu navigation but "
"also triggering recording on split style cameras as well as communicating "
"the available SD-card space, syncing the current date, writing to the OSD "
"and turning the camera or WiFi function (if available) on and off."
msgstr ""
"该协议本身不仅支持完整的相机 OSD 菜单导航，还支持在分体式相机上触发录像，以及通信可用 SD 卡空间、同步当前日期、向 OSD "
"写入内容，以及开关相机或 WiFi 功能（如可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:14
#: 991010a65ee34ff284cfef24bee8f8e0
msgid ""
"Not all features of the protocol are currently supported in ArduPilot and "
"not all features of the protocol are supported on all cameras. In particular"
" it is important to distinguish between cameras that support the \"5-button "
"protocol\" (generally camera -only devices such as the RunCam Racer) and "
"cameras that support the \"2-button protocol\" (generally split-style "
"cameras). These two protocols originated from the 5-key external OSD "
"keyboard and 2 buttons present on split-style cameras. Equally important is "
"to understand that the RunCam device protocol is almost a direct mapping "
"from the hardware - so the way that you would physically press a button is "
"the way that the protocol is invoked. The only caveat here is that the "
"5-button protocol recognizes keys being released, whereas the 2-button "
"protocol does not, leading to some limitations in the way that menus and "
"options can be navigated."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前并非支持该协议的所有功能，且并非所有相机都支持该协议的所有功能。特别需要区分支持「5 键协议」的相机（通常是纯相机设备，如 "
"RunCam Racer）和支持「2 键协议」的相机（通常是分体式相机）。这两种协议源于可与相机配合使用的 5 键外部 OSD 键盘和分体式相机上的 2"
" 个按钮。同样重要的是要了解，RunCam 设备协议几乎是硬件的直接映射——因此物理按下按钮的方式就是调用协议的方式。唯一需要注意的是，5 "
"键协议能识别按键释放，而 2 键协议不能，这导致菜单和选项的导航方式存在一些限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:16
#: e5a405b07918421583149470abb7b72e
msgid ""
"Lately, similar to TBS Smartaudio and IRC Tramp, other companies (for "
"instance Caddx) have started to adopt support for the protocol in their "
"cameras. Currently supported features in ArduPilot"
msgstr ""
"近来，与 TBS Smartaudio 和 IRC Tramp 类似，其他公司（例如 Caddx）也开始在其相机中支持该协议。ArduPilot "
"目前支持的功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:19
#: 789e23754ed84ef28ef603f49ad5b1b4
msgid "Full camera OSD control"
msgstr "完整相机 OSD 控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:20
#: adcbfd7672da4216b925787ce730ded6
msgid "Starting/Stopping recording on split style cameras"
msgstr "在分体式相机上开始/停止录像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:23
#: c37643e40d5540aebad0f26a78467ac3
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:25
#: dd07430c653c43ef9dea627ba2becb21
msgid ""
"One free non-inverted UART on the FC is required (TX and RX). Connect TX to "
"RX, RX to TX and GND to GND. Pinouts for serial ports on The Cube can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-pixhawk-serial-mapping>`. Check the :ref:`board "
"documentation<common-autopilots>` for other boards."
msgstr ""
"飞控上需要一个空闲的非反向 UART（TX 和 RX）。将 TX 连接到 RX，RX 连接到 TX，GND 连接到 GND。The Cube "
"的串口引脚定义可在 :ref:`此处 <common-pixhawk-serial-mapping>` 找到。其他飞控请查阅 "
":ref:`飞控文档<common-autopilots>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:31
#: 048824e39d3c41189f376f7f9f7c8458
msgid ""
"On some camera-only devices the pinout is labeled such that TX should be "
"connected to TX and RX to RX. If your RunCam device is not recognized try "
"reversing the signal wires. Not all cameras support a UART ground pin - they"
" expect to get ground from the power supply."
msgstr ""
"在某些纯相机设备上，引脚定义标注为 TX 连接 TX、RX 连接 RX。如果您的 RunCam 设备未被识别，请尝试对调信号线。并非所有相机都支持 "
"UART 地线引脚——它们期望从电源获取地线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:33
#: 1932ebdc8d9f40b797aeb32ea9dad029
msgid ""
"The camera must be in UART control mode. On split-style cameras this should "
"be the default. On camera-only devices you will need to follow the procedure"
" for putting the device in UART control mode. Consult your RunCam manual for"
" more details."
msgstr ""
"相机必须处于 UART 控制模式。分体式相机默认应处于此模式。纯相机设备需按相应步骤进入 UART 控制模式，详情请参阅 RunCam 手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:35
#: fa00b4dcc33b4199989e10ce27950eeb
msgid ""
"Note that so-called \"Joystick control\" is not supported and some devices "
"only support joystick control, so be careful when selecting the RunCam model"
" you are going to use. The following devices have been tested successfully -"
" RunCam Split 3s Micro, RunCam Split 2s, RunCam Racer 3."
msgstr ""
"请注意，所谓「摇杆控制」不受支持，且部分设备仅支持摇杆控制，因此在选择 RunCam 型号时请注意。以下设备已通过测试：RunCam Split 3s "
"Micro、RunCam Split 2s、RunCam Racer 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:37
#: af518d027bfb405da0d60a3e53ea1e81
msgid ""
"In order to recognize the RunCam serial protocol on the UART, set the UART "
"serial protocol to 26. So for instance for serial port 5, set "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 26 (RunCam protocol). The "
"correlation between serial port numbering and UART physical ports for your "
"autopilot should be documented in its description page linked :ref:`here "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
"为使 UART 识别 RunCam 串行协议，请将 UART 串口协议设置为 26。例如对于串口 5，设置 :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL"
" <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` = 26（RunCam 协议）。飞控串口编号与 UART 物理端口的对应关系应在其文档页面中有说明，链接见 "
":ref:`此处 <common-autopilots>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:39
#: f8231c378a3246759a5d4918a3d131c8
msgid ""
"When the camera is connected correctly and the serial port configured "
"correctly you will see a message similar to the following at boot: ``APM: "
"RunCam initialized, features 0x0077, 2-key OSD`` otherwise you will see "
"``APM: RunCam device not found``."
msgstr ""
"当相机正确连接且串口配置正确后，启动时将看到类似如下的消息：``APM: RunCam initialized, features 0x0077, "
"2-key OSD``，否则将显示 ``APM: RunCam device not found``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:41
#: 39774b79bf924e9985b397f0afda0f5a
msgid ""
"The camera must be powered and fully booted in order to accept commands. "
"This can take some time and the delay between the autopilot booting and the "
"camera being probed can be controlled through `CAM_RC_BT_DELAY``. The camera"
" will be probed repeatedly until ``CAM_RC_BT_DELAY`` elapses, but once that "
"has expired the camera will not be probed again."
msgstr ""
"相机必须通电并完全启动后才能接受命令。这可能需要一些时间，飞控启动与相机探测之间的延迟可通过 `CAM_RC_BT_DELAY ``. The "
"camera will be probed repeatedly until `` CAM_RC_BT_DELAY`` "
"超时前将持续探测相机，但超时后将不再探测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:43
#: 7be19e35648a41d1b08290a25e59f97b
msgid ""
"Some split-style cameras support three modes - video standby, video start "
"and picture mode. It is not possible to tell from the RunCam device protocol"
" whether this is the type of camera in use and so this must be configured. "
"Set `CAM_RC_TYPE`` = 2. Most other cameras should be fine with the default, "
"however some of the later cameras have a bug where video start/stop protocol"
" commands are not properly supported and a workaround has to be used. "
"Cameras known to have this problem are the RunCam Split4k and require "
"setting ``CAM_RC_TYPE`` = 3. In addition to this problem RunCam Hybrid "
"cameras have a QR code mode which can also cause problems for recording "
"control. For RunCam Hybrids set ``CAM_RC_TYPE`` = 4. For RunCam2 4K camera, "
"set ``CAM_RC_TYPE<CAM_RC_TYPE`` = 5."
msgstr ""
"部分分体式相机支持三种模式——视频待机、视频开始和拍照模式。无法通过 RunCam 设备协议判断当前使用的是哪种类型的相机，因此必须手动配置。设置 "
"`CAM_RC_TYPE `` = 2. Most other cameras should be fine with the default, "
"however some of the later cameras have a bug where video start/stop protocol"
" commands are not properly supported and a workaround has to be used. "
"Cameras known to have this problem are the RunCam Split4k and require "
"setting `` CAM_RC_TYPE `` = 3. In addition to this problem RunCam Hybrid "
"cameras have a QR code mode which can also cause problems for recording "
"control. For RunCam Hybrids set `` CAM_RC_TYPE `` = 4. For RunCam2 4K "
"camera, set `` CAM_RC_TYPE<CAM_RC_TYPE`` = 5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:45
#: 8d04da474406436cb0873e7a2d7dd3c3
msgid ""
"Note that RunCam are bringing out new cameras all the time and seem to "
"change the video controls with almost every camera, so if you are having "
"issues - particularly with video control - try one of the other camera types"
" for ``CAM_RC_TYPE``."
msgstr ""
"请注意，RunCam 不断推出新相机，且几乎每款相机都会更改视频控制方式，因此如果遇到问题（尤其是视频控制问题），请尝试为 "
"``CAM_RC_TYPE`` 选择其他相机类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:47
#: 5d794d98ddd74e3bb56693244dc3e020
msgid ""
"In order to control start and stop of video recording from a radio "
"transmitter set a free rc channel to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 78 to enable "
"triggering from that RC input channel. If the switch is in the low position "
"then video recording is stopped, if in the high position then video "
"recording is started."
msgstr ""
"要通过遥控器控制视频录制的开始和停止，请将一个空闲 RC 通道设置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 78，以启用从该 RC "
"输入通道触发。拨杆处于低位时停止视频录制，处于高位时开始视频录制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:49
#: de40c7082f704db2a359110e164b4b1f
msgid ""
"In order to control entering the OSD menu set a free rc channel to "
"``RCx_OPTION`` = 79. If the switch is in the low position then the OSD menu "
"is exited, if in the high position then the OSD menu is entered. The OSD "
"menu can also be entered by default through rolling hard right while "
"disarmed."
msgstr ""
"要控制进入 OSD 菜单，请将一个空闲 RC 通道设置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 79。拨杆处于低位时退出 OSD 菜单，处于高位时进入 "
"OSD 菜单。也可通过在上锁状态下大幅向右拨横滚杆默认进入 OSD 菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:52
#: 344a705c11a74b709c4bca32b4c46196
msgid "OSD Menu Control"
msgstr "OSD 菜单控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:54
#: 4a80bb7fdc304f9baba5908dbae7d0da
msgid ""
"A big part of the RunCam feature is support for the OSD menu. The OSD menu "
"allows various properties of a connected camera to be controlled via RC "
"stick gestures. The easiest way to enter the OSD menu is to push the stick "
"for Roll hard right. This gesture is enabled by default but can be changed "
"by setting ``CAM_RC_CONTROL``. Once in the menu, the Pitch stick will allow "
"you to navigated between menu items and Roll right will usually allow you to"
" select items or navigate into sub-menus. The OSD menu can only be entered "
"while disarmed."
msgstr ""
"RunCam 功能的重要部分是对 OSD 菜单的支持。OSD 菜单允许通过 RC 摇杆手势控制已连接相机的各种属性。进入 OSD "
"菜单最简便的方式是将横滚杆大幅向右推。此手势默认启用，但可通过设置 ``CAM_RC_CONTROL`` "
"更改。进入菜单后，俯仰杆可在菜单项之间导航，向右横滚通常可选择项目或进入子菜单。OSD 菜单只能在上锁状态下进入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:56
#: fb57b4247e874e0d9f310cc4e9c9d6b2
msgid "The transmitter sticks can be used to control the OSD menu as follows:"
msgstr "遥控器摇杆可按如下方式控制 OSD 菜单："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:62
#: 2ff7c46928224ddea8f669aecc4ff2f6
msgid ""
"Split-style cameras differ significantly from regular RunCams in terms of "
"what gestures are allowed. On a RunCam with UART control the stick gestures "
"match the operation of the remote keyboard that can be used with the camera."
" The roll and pitch stick gestures correspond to up, down, left and right on"
" the keyboard and yaw corresponds to enter. On a Split-style camera pitch up"
" and down have the same effect of cycling through menu items and enter is "
"roll right. Although every effort has been made to make the user interfaces "
"of the two-camera styles consistent, deficiencies in the RunCam remote "
"protocol make this challenging. The two most obvious differences are:"
msgstr ""
"分体式相机与普通 RunCam 在允许的手势方面有显著差异。具有 UART 控制的 "
"RunCam，摇杆手势与可与相机配合使用的遥控键盘操作相对应：横滚和俯仰摇杆手势对应键盘的上、下、左、右，偏航对应回车。分体式相机上，俯仰向上和向下具有相同的循环浏览菜单项效果，回车为向右横滚。尽管尽力使两种相机风格的用户界面保持一致，但"
" RunCam 遥控协议的缺陷使这一目标具有挑战性。最明显的两个差异为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:64
#: 510b967599b24c499973a5e6e89af1a0
msgid ""
"Split-style cameras allow exit from a sub-menu through the left gesture "
"whereas regular RunCams' require the exit menu option to be selected."
msgstr "分体式相机可通过向左手势退出子菜单，而普通 RunCam 则需要选择退出菜单选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:65
#: 757cd5d9b2144c6fb35e564bf9c61662
msgid ""
"Split-style cameras allow exit from the OSD through the left gesture whereas"
" regular RunCams' require the use of the configured exit OSD command (either"
" a TX switch or yaw left)."
msgstr "分体式相机可通过向左手势退出 OSD，而普通 RunCam 则需要使用配置好的退出 OSD 命令（TX 拨杆或向左偏航）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:68
#: cb7099caf8d04bf4b9d5c6cb97d5901c
msgid "OSD Menu and OSD Interaction"
msgstr "OSD 菜单与 OSD 交互"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-runcam.rst:70
#: 52cfc61cccc54287ab1ab5fe278b048b
msgid ""
"One of the features of the ArduPilot implementation of OSD menu control is "
"that the autopilot will switch off the regular flight OSD when the camera "
"OSD is entered. It will also prevent arming whilst in OSD mode. When the OSD"
" menu is exited the regular flight OSD will be re-enabled and arming "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot OSD 菜单控制实现的功能之一是：进入相机 OSD 时，飞控会关闭常规飞行 OSD，同时在 OSD 模式下阻止解锁。退出 OSD "
"菜单后，常规飞行 OSD 将重新启用，并允许解锁。"
